        "en": "Welcoming reception and clinical personnel"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The vast majority of clients commend the staff at the Morley surgery for their friendly greetings and attentive service. Reviewers frequently praise veterinary surgeon Maria and the nursing team for their patient, unhurried consultations. A couple of critical reviewers expressed deep disappointment regarding clinical decision-making and price increases."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for sensitive pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently note how well veterinary staff interact with animals, particularly timid rescues and reactive dogs. Clients describe how practitioners take time to settle large nervous dogs before starting examinations, using calm voices and gentle approaches. Feline patients are treated with care during health checks, chipping, and neutering."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 5,
      "title": {
        "en": "Successful treatments alongside diagnostic disputes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers report contrasting outcomes regarding clinical treatments at the Morley branch. Many pet parents praise successful surgical recoveries, effective routine neutering, and accurate diagnostic assessments for unwell pets. However, two long-standing clients raised serious concerns regarding disputed diagnoses and expensive investigative tests."
      }
    }
